      "id": "en:body",
      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Soraka restores (90/110/130/150/170 + (50% Ability Power)) Health to another allied champion. If Soraka is affected by Rejuvenation, the Health cost will be reduced by 80/85/90/95/100%, and the target will gain Rejuvenation for 2.5 seconds. This Ability cannot be used if Soraka is below (5% Health) Health .",
      "variant": null
    },
